It is probably hidden by some item on the stairs.. to avoid this, I always
try to keep stairs clean. I try to avoid killing monsters on stairs, and
if someone dies there or drops something there, I clear the stuff to the
next square ASAP.

> Any ideas? Am I missing something, is there another way to get back up
> out of Gehennom?

You could try a cursed potion of gain level. They don't always work when
you're carrying the amulet, but it *may* work. Level teleports never work
when you carry the amulet, but if you have teleport control, you could
drop the amulet and teleport to the level above, then come back to get the
amulet. 

And one trick is to first read a scroll of amnesia (to forget the
locations of items seen on the screen) and then a scroll of magic mapping
to find the stairs. (Scrolls of amnesia are among the ones I normally
blank, but you might have one of those..)

